{"ID":"20251124160756-o96wt3t","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251124160756-o96wt3t","title":"UPL11——内存管理","type":"doc","updated":"20251126112159"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124160756-nbwjn35","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251124160756-nbwjn35","updated":"20251124161014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垃圾回收时机"}]},{"ID":"20251124160957-7hxd42m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124160957-7hxd42m","updated":"20251124161012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先，我们应该尽量避免垃圾回收，因为垃圾回收将带来极大的 CPU 开销\n但是如果我们不得不进行垃圾回收时，都建议在合适的时机手动进行，降低玩家的感知度"}]},{"ID":"20251124161007-x2eb8ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161007-x2eb8ob","updated":"20251124161007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20251124161006-yjrsu23","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251124161006-yjrsu23","updated":"20251124161006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124161006-qbeblap","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251124161006-qbeblap","updated":"20251124161006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124161006-gizptqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161006-gizptqf","updated":"20251124161006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏暂停时"}]}]},{"ID":"20251124161006-c7b7hfo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251124161006-c7b7hfo","updated":"20251124161006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124161006-yav20f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161006-yav20f0","updated":"20251124161006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏过场景时"}]}]},{"ID":"20251124161006-uqb4rl4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251124161006-uqb4rl4","updated":"20251124161006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124161006-fkarrw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161006-fkarrw1","updated":"20251124161006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏显示读条界面时"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251124161004-5wnxvos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161004-5wnxvos","updated":"20251124161004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251124161001-pe5gr0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161001-pe5gr0i","updated":"20251124161002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总之，需要在玩家察觉不到或不关心突然的性能下降而打断游戏行为时手动调用垃圾回收"}]},{"ID":"20251124161014-u94dg6s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251124161014-u94dg6s","updated":"20251126102825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结构体参数传递时的考虑"}]},{"ID":"20251124161025-5ih4kvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161025-5ih4kvk","updated":"20251124161037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由于值传递和引用传递的区别，导致如果大结构体在函数之间传递时比起引用传递是更耗性能的\n因此在进行大型结构体数据传递时，我们可以权衡是否使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240717175735-w6i6678","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"ref"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 传递"}]},{"ID":"20251126102822-m7waw23","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251126102822-m7waw23","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251126102825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251126102825-nzpd9t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251126102825-nzpd9t0","updated":"20251126102912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意，如果希望函数内部对结构体对象的修改不影响外部，则不能使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ref"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 传递"}]}]},{"ID":"20251124161045-tbpb88n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251124161045-tbpb88n","updated":"20251126103155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用 StringBuilder 替代 String"}]},{"ID":"20251124161053-dc4i81w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161053-dc4i81w","updated":"20251124161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只要你要对字符串做大量修改，比如追加、拼接、替换等等\n并且循环次数不确定或较大，就必须用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240322122838-nr8hxth","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"StringBuilder"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251124161055-kkfw71p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161055-kkfw71p","updated":"20251124161055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20251124161118-vpiwtth","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251124161118-vpiwtth","updated":"20251124161128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"string s = \"\";\nfor (int i = 0; i \u003c 10000; i++)\n{\n    s += i; // 糟糕\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251124161129-s2whv1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161129-s2whv1r","updated":"20251124161222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果一个字符串频繁变化，使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 去存储它，那么在变化的过程中会产生很多垃圾\n由于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的规则（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 对象不可变，新字符串会生成新对象），每次变化都会分配新内容，拷贝旧内容，产生内存垃圾\n10000 次循环，就是 10000 次分配和拷贝，以及垃圾的产生，而如果我们使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"StringBuilder"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251124161223-k4os225","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251124161223-k4os225","updated":"20251124161230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"var sb = new StringBuilder();\nfor (int i = 0; i \u003c 10000; i++)\n{\n    sb.Append(i);\n}\ns = sb.ToString();\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251124161237-1y17d1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161237-1y17d1z","updated":"20251124161237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用它不仅可以减少性能消耗，还可以减少垃圾的产生"}]},{"ID":"20251124161245-q9iq317","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161245-q9iq317","updated":"20251124161254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用准则："}]},{"ID":"20251126103116-3mo4tr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251126103116-3mo4tr2","updated":"20251126103118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"StringBuilder"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的一般情况："}]},{"ID":"20251124161254-kf4r7sr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251124161254-kf4r7sr","updated":"20251124161308"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124161254-ej3nrlu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251124161254-ej3nrlu","updated":"20251124161254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124161254-509u7tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161254-509u7tn","updated":"20251124161254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多次循环拼接（成千上万）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251124161254-ghbmgf7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251124161254-ghbmgf7","updated":"20251124161308"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124161254-c8c3hls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124161254-c8c3hls","updated":"20251124161308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240904204929-jh66ge2","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Replace"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（替换）"}]}]}