漏当成规范："}]},{"ID":"20251126111900-qkvvmrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251126111900-qkvvmrq","updated":"20251126111905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong u","TextMarkTextContent":"不要只凭经验这个 API 可能有 GC，而是去 Profiler 里确定，避免过度优化或优化错方向"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251124165015-cqwaqw7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251124165015-cqwaqw7","updated":"20251126112159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DOTS 系统"}]},{"ID":"20251124165035-rteo8c1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124165035-rteo8c1","updated":"20251124165119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 中的 DOTS（数据导向的技术栈：Data-Oriented Tech Stack）系统是一套专门为了把 CPU、内存效率压榨到极致的开发方式 + 工具集合\n是用来做高性能、大规模对象、可并行游戏逻辑的，它的三大核心是：ECS + Job System + Burst"}]},{"ID":"20251124165100-xw1ze70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124165100-xw1ze70","updated":"20251124165100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它可以帮助我们："}]},{"ID":"20251124165053-ub1szxw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251124165053-ub1szxw","updated":"20251124165056"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124165053-doe94jr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251124165053-doe94jr","updated":"20251124165056"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124165053-mc32z8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124165053-mc32z8s","updated":"20251124165056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"极大提升 CPU 性能和可拓展性"}]}]},{"ID":"20251124165053-zbh7nkc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251124165053-zbh7nkc","updated":"20251124165053"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251124165053-52btk9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251124165053-52btk9i","updated":"20251124165053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更高效的内存布局和更少 GC 压力"}]}]},{"ID":"20251124165053-8ejxeux","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"P